<title>POLAND: ZEW TURNS TO LOSS IN JULY.</title>
<headline>ZEW TURNS TO LOSS IN JULY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		28.70 vs   0.48 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	  31.18 vs   1.03 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 5.49 vs   1.47 profit</p>
<p> Sales		    4.86 vs  13.88</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		26.94 vs   3.39 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	  26.94 vs   6.22 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.51 vs   9.47</p>
<p> Sales		   87.79 vs  89.52</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish electrode maker is Zaklady</p>
<p>Elektrod Weglowych SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
